  "description": "Embrace the spirit of the 1960s with this set of 12 digital papers featuring pop-art hippie young women, inspired by vintage comic books.\nThese high-resolution PNGs are sized at 3600 x 3600 pixels and 300 DPI, making them perfect for adding a touch of retro counterculture charm to your creative projects.\nIdeal for crafting cards, scrapbooks, junk journals, and more, these papers bring a vibrant and free-spirited twist to your designs.\nUse them to create eye-catching pieces that capture the essence of the 1960s with a vintage pop-art flair.",
